ready: 1
kind: surface
id: consolidation.surface.log
module: consolidation
name: Memory log
surface_kind: screen
system: sys.cli
audience: The owner, or the agent through the status tools
summary: Terminal output of recent runs and what each one changed.
elements:
  - name: Run list
    description: Newest first; each run with stack, time, and counts learned, updated, forgotten, held, and quarantined, plus a budget note
  - name: Run entries
    description: For one run, each change with the memory's kind and summary, the change, why it mattered (emotion label and top appraisal reasons), and the sessions it came from
states:
  - No runs yet, with when the next sleep is due
  - Deleted memories shown as a memory of their kind that was forgotten, without content
